The definition of $n$-dimensional space is sometimes applied to $n$-dimensional normed spaces. The latter include all $n$-dimensional normed spaces as well as any normed space whose topology can be induced by a norm on a finite-dimensional vector space. It is also used for $n$-dimensional topological vector spaces.
